"""One-shot seed: operators (16) + lead funnel (pipeline + 7 stages + sources +
lost reasons) + 1687 leads imported from the legacy CRM dump.

Run on the server ONCE after the bootstrap migrations:
    docker compose exec backend python -m scripts.seed_initial_leads

The script is idempotent: if you re-run it, existing operators (matched by
login -> phone), pipeline/stages/sources/lost-reasons (by code), and leads
(by phone) are left untouched.

All data is embedded in this file — no CSV needed at runtime.
"""

